Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(activity):=20flying=20rock/frame=20retain?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20under=20classify=20early=20latch=20(~2.4=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet flying still paid full classify visit clear+resolvePins after #138 early
latch (parked-only). Flying frame retain keeps prior id lists when the visit
set is unchanged and every rock's glass/runway membership, pin bits, sim tier,
and pose stay stable; per-rock flying retain covers partial disc churn.
Wakes on visit identity, pose, pinFacts revision, extents, membership flip,
imminent collision, mining/tether pins. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
---
